[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:07.70]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:12.60]left a single note and went on their way
[00:17.88]I never got their name until the credits
[00:22.66]now it plays here every single day
[00:25.82]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:30.00]One note at a time
[00:34.68]from people passing through
[00:39.90]a name beside a line
[00:44.74]and part of it is you
[00:52.80]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
